Description: VeltOS File Explorer, a Windows 11 style file manager
 Browse files and folders in the layout of Windows 11 File Explorer: tabs
 in the title bar, a command bar (New, cut, copy, paste, rename, delete,
 Sort, View), back/forward/up with an address box and a search box, a
 navigation pane with Home, pinned folders, This PC and the Recycle Bin,
 Details, Tiles and icon views, and a status bar.
 .
 Copying, moving and deleting use KDE's file engine (KIO): progress in the
 notification area, questions when a file already exists, the
 freedesktop.org trash. Folders open in File Explorer by default.
